aming (pitch as a map of who can reach each area first), the cross-sport comparison, and the speed-of-reconfiguration conclusion â€” that are entirely absent from the two existing sections.","Revise at least one H2 heading so that it naturally expresses the demand lens ('geometry football cup final' or a clear geometry-of-football idea). Neither 'Constructing Uncertainty' nor 'Forcing Defensive Choices' does this; the deterministic standards reading flags this as a warning.","Rewrite the ending to close on the most consequential sourced unresolved question â€” whether Argentina's preparation against Spain's triangle approach alters the geometry contest â€” using the source's own framing rather than the current vague gesture toward 'flow' and 'the trophy'.","Vary the citation pattern: 'According to [Geometry, football and the World Cup final](url)...' is a template construction in the same class the instructions limit to two appearances; the draft already risks that limit and should integrate attributions as natural prose."],"report":"**Deterministic gate status.** The standards reading records one hard error (`body-too-short`: 437 words found, 600 required) and one warning (`demand-lens-missing-h2`). The draft cannot be published in its current form.\n\n**Failure-layer diagnosis.** The earliest causal failure is the writer model, not the source material or the assignment. The primary source â€” [Geometry, football and the World Cup final](https://theconversation.com/geometry-football-and-the-world-cup-final-287792) â€” is substantive. It contains Pedro Porro's 58th-minute goal as a named, timed, match-specific example; Kylian MbappÃ©'s post-match quote attributing France's collapse to \"a lack of communication\" in the press; an explained cross-sport analogy connecting Spain's triangles to the Chicago Bulls' Tex Winter triangle offence under Phil Jackson; two research citations (Nature player-tracking data, PLOS ONE passing networks); and a distinct conceptual move treating the pitch as a probability map rather than a static spatial diagram. The evidence budget the production run computes (120 licensed assertions, 600â€“850 word target) is consistent with the source's actual depth. The writer used a thin slice of that material, producing 437 words and two sections, and never touched Porro, MbappÃ©, the basketball comparison, or the research-based framing.\n\n**Claim-level audit.** Every factual claim the draft does make is supported by the witnessed source: Spain 2â€“0 France in the semi-final; the passing-triangle impression of numerical superiority; French defenders arriving a fraction too late; each pass forcing a defender to commit to one of three choices; Spain controlling when and where space would appear; triangle shape varying with ball speed, defender orientation, and available pitch area. No invented numbers, quotes, or causal mechanisms are present. The citations are syntactically adequate but patterned: \"According to [source title]...\" appears in paragraph three and approaches the template-construction limit the instructions cap at two.\n\n**Structure failures.** The draft has two H2 sections against a required three to five. Neither heading naturally expresses the search-demand lens; the deterministic warning is accurate. The ending gestures at the final as \"a laboratory for tactical reconfiguration\" without landing on any sourced, unresolved concrete question.\n\n**Fairness and harm.** No criticism of a person or institution is present; no response requirement arises. The subject is sports tactics analysis; no harm, sensationalism, or commercial-influence concern is visible.\n\n**Required path forward.** This is a bounded writer-model repair. The source packet is sufficient; no additional reporting is needed. A replay of the writer stage against the same source should incorporate the Porro goal, the MbappÃ© quote, the basketball analogy, the probability-map framing, and the passing-network research â€” bringing the draft to at least 600 words across at least three developed H2 sections, with one heading that naturally carries a geometry-of-football concept and an ending that closes on the specific open question the source raises about Argentina's preparation."}ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;W1SK99wmltpZUi4yHl8IT0No-oiPxf_1TkLQzNaGyPQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;08oRubOcbp7l-N4c21EkP565gPFFxz5cF7EirsZkxvcƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GNuZXlZsfosZxKlzzOqASfC3NhgeKw9YBz06aahYHxwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;11VHaFl22Wh-r5-DYr-R_q8QWWHvwExqqMd5t9Loqeoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxclaude-code-cli-invocationsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;L_iFkyCIehry20iSrCso5n-krxq2_D_u_-TvjcfdvNUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ito8Leiy5O9BnNhacdUoxR2QFi3EqfHkm0bW05XKaQkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkf98.087ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nzttgpRVIOxR7ddYE0_9EwzBxDNYevqLXuxZxHUmSd4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NyQZVfi2678n0Nq51NEUZrUQAUgE8iPClk3RxX2WD-Eƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;q4qY7PI1eS25wZjwvQb3qUJWor784VtKE_HMWNRxoKEƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;BQ0jL7JzsR_9qjgIMhucUUfeYD3ykbPh1vnVwbV5w_Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxexchange-20260719-160152-5bf3d8ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wB-nkNKJMBdeJWIq08ISVIfGKIrQMAHC_MgdqQItzMQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;YQgYjWpapNNSLass4p5xAwYt1m5oHVoyf8epvd1raKUƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WzkW07dzZKnDJDognsMRVzWnHMdE1pNWKw_E3OO86Eoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjcompletionƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wKIgqYLllIt3JpHI9V4Hu1qrol1GAHB7KOL_jiRgdMoƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ENOkTomPMZi8Uw_-nYYzKCbB-Hj1TXXeVym3oRi8LWQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd6000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6p3ld1iBzsQLi1kHpc4b3yh9tdAXLfeAVLui2kVyvIwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ICngV3r-htb2WxN69ebxcbYLw1Eub_qYiZ-EMMeiG8oƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qRZP4x6ZvtvjwfN2qqwNBJbwrX6QiykdDe_CpbLkP4Aƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkz␀œVYou hold an independent editorial assessment duty. Do not rewrite the manuscript and do not authorize publication directly. Select exactly one bounded customer tool through the supplied schema and put all substantive judgment in the prose report field.

